# C8 anion addition: FREE HOO- reference, ddCOSMO(water) to MATCH the complex.
#
# The binding energy subtracts this species from the embedded QM/MM complex, so
# the two must share a solvation model. The complex (rs_anion) is QM/XTB and can
# only use ddCOSMO (plain CPCM is not implemented for QM/XTB), so the free HOO-
# is redone here with ddCOSMO too. ../free_hoo_b973c used CPCM(Water) and is kept
# only to show the solvation-model difference.
#
# Bare anion (no counter-ion): the reaction cat + HOO- -> [cat...HOO-]- is
# balanced on the anion, cat being neutral. Isolated 3-atom species, no host.
# Opt + Freq in ONE job.
! B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
